<fighter_config>

	<!--
	Properties from the fighter content (the one inside the <fighter ... /> 
	* id			::	The character stats name in your character DATA MainTimeline (or Main).
	* alternateID	::	When you put in the id (i.e alternateID = "luigi"),
						character with that id can be accessible as alternate skin.
	* charName		::	The name that appear upon choosing character (does NOT sync with actual character name)
	* cssName		::	The character slots name, appear on top of your slots
	* txtNumber		::	The character slots name's size, in case the name being too long
	* info			::	You can put whatever you wrote down, and it will appear on INFO section (WIP)
	* resource		::	The GOOD SHIT, where the external bitmap is added, mostly with a directory url
		1.	portrait		::	The portrait that slide upon character selected
		2.	icon			::	The icon image of your character, smaller one
		3.	fs_cutin		::	The triangle that appears when FS is activated (aka Final Smash Cutin)
								can be passed if Beta character has it 
		4.	costume_data	::	The additional costume data for the character (.as file)	(color vault xd)
		
		They mostly follow the examples below
	-->

